### Create a show with 20 seats
POST http://localhost:8081/api/shows
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Avengers Premiere", "venue": "PVR Hyderabad", "showTime": "2026-12-20T19:00:00", "seatCount": 20}

> {% client.global.set("showId", response.body.id); %}

### List shows
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shows

### View seats
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shows/{{showId}}/seats

### Book seat S1
POST http://localhost:8081/api/shows/{{showId}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{"seatNumber": "S1", "userName": "mohammad"}

### Book the same seat again (should give 409)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/shows/{{showId}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{"seatNumber": "S1", "userName": "sameer"}

### All bookings of the show
GET http://localhost:8081/api/shows/{{showId}}/bookings